he form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":212382,"global_rank":263771},{"name":"ylow/aoc2022","owner":"ylow","html_url":"https://github.com/ylow/aoc2022","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212381,"global_rank":263779},{"name":"datatalking/app_boilerplate_test","owner":"datatalking","html_url":"https://github.com/datatalking/app_boilerplate_test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212381,"global_rank":263780},{"name":"elementc/adventofcode2023","owner":"elementc","html_url":"https://github.com/elementc/adventofcode2023","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212381,"global_rank":263782},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":212376,"global_rank":263801},{"name":"huzaifa-vartana/advent-of-code","owner":"huzaifa-vartana","html_url":"https://github.com/huzaifa-vartana/advent-of-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"http